In this model qualification names a fixed import and does not introduce new symbols, so repairing one use cannot alter another use's resolution. A renderer can keep its cached drawing if only the spelling changes and the resolved entries' properties are unchanged. A presentation cache that displays the reference spelling must be invalidated. An index of importers and reverse references avoids scanning unrelated documents, but scanning only direct users of the renamed definition would miss the original unqualified \texttt{Blue} use.
